@model Fanex.Affiliate.Admin.Core.DTO.Email.AffInformationEmail

<table>
    <tr>
        <td>
            <p style="color: #313131; margin: 0; line-height: 1.5">
                Dear @Model.FirstName,<br /><br />

                Congratulations! Your affiliate application has been approved. We are thrilled to officially welcome you as a 12BET Affiliate Partner.<br /><br />

                As our partner, you will have access to a variety of marketing resources and tools to help you succeed. Please use the following login details to access your 12BET Affiliate Account:<br /><br />

                🔗 Site link: <a href="@(Model.UserSiteUrl + "/en")">@Model.UserSiteUrl</a><br />
                👤 Username: @Model.UserName<br />
                🔑 Password: @Model.Password<br />
                (Note: This is a temporary password. Please change it upon your first login for security reasons.)<br /><br />

                If you need custom-sized banners, geo-specific links, or any other assistance, don’t hesitate to reach out. We are here to support you every step of the way and ensure you have a successful and rewarding partnership with 12BET.<br /><br />

                Be it a custom sized image or a geo-specific link, do not hesitate to reach out for any assistance. We are here to support you in every step of the way and ensure that you have a successful and rewarding partnership with 12BET.<br /><br />

                🚀 Stay Updated on the Latest Promotions! 🚀<br />
                For new updates and special promotions for 12BET Affiliates, subscribe to our Telegram channel.<br />
                We look forward to a successful collaboration!<br /><br />

                Best regards,<br /><br />
            </p>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>
@Raw(Model.ContactInfo)